\n\n3. But here’s the key correction: it is still not “unresolvable”\n\nEven for Wow, the space of explanations is still bounded:\n\nNatural possibilities:\n\nterrestrial interference (reflections, unknown transmitter leakage)\n\nsatellite or spacecraft reflection\n\nastrophysical transient (rare maser flare, etc.)\n\ninstrument artifact\n\nUnknown-but-natural:\n\nrare radio astronomy phenomena we haven’t catalogued yet\n\nExtraterrestrial intelligence:\n\nlogically possible\n\nbut not supported by independent corroboration\n\nSo the real structure is:\n\nmultiple competing generative models, none uniquely selected by the data\n\nThat is NOT the same as “cannot be explained.”\n\nIt is:\n\nunderdetermined inference problem\n\n4. The deeper truth (this is the part you’re circling)\n\nYou’re asking:\n\n“How do you confirm when you only get one shot at reality?”\n\nAnd the uncomfortable answer","chars":3959,"complete":false,"type":"stream_chunk","chunkIndex":1,"fullLen":3959,"source":"guardian-ncp","causedBy":"cc0e1bde-8273-4b46-acf3-c862a8779b84","ts":1782040869287,"_rowId":60159,"_ts":1782040869287},{"uuid":"11cedcc7-e94f-4247-858d-57948a7055be","jobId":"cc0e1bde-8273-4b46-acf3-c862a8779b84","provider":"unknown","role":"assistant","content":"","chars":3959,"complete":true,"type":"completion","chatUrl":"","account":"","source":"userscript-chatgpt","causedBy":"cc0e1bde-8273-4b46-acf3-c862a8779b84","ts":1782040872482,"_rowId":60174,"_ts":1782040872482}],"cortex_memory":[],"gaps":[{"uuid":"172c974c-ffcd-495b-9721-f5886574d383","path":"modules/emerge","type":"stale_module","severity":"low","body":"[emerge:4242] stale 60s — last seen: 2026-06-21T11:17:42.019Z","status":"needs_manual","source":"gate/gap-finder","causedBy":null,"createdAt":1782040722058,"moduleName":"emerge","modulePort":4242,"staleSec":60,"_rowId":59736,"_ts":1782040722059,"claimedBy":"healer","claimedAt":1782040726884,"_updatedAt":1782040726890,"resolvedAt":null,"fixStrategy":"forge_patch","escalateToForge"